<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-indigo-700 mb-6">About the Trio</h1>

<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-lg text-gray-700">
  <p>
    <strong>Mitchell McFadgen Trio</strong> is a modern jazz group based in Halifax, Nova Scotia. Led by electric guitarist <strong>Mitchell McFadgen</strong> from Cape Breton, the trio explores creative improvisation and lyrical melodies inspired by artists like Bill Frisell, Brad Mehldau, and Julian Lage.
  </p>
  <p>
    The band features <strong>Tyler MacDonald</strong> (drums), also from Cape Breton, and <strong>Orion Leidl Wilson</strong> (electric bass), hailing from Wolfville, Nova Scotia. Together, they blend their Atlantic Canadian roots with a contemporary jazz sensibility, performing original compositions and reimagined standards.
  </p>
</div>
